    treatments
      [32m✔[39m GET /api/v3/treatments/<id> returns it
      [32m✔[39m PUT /api/v3/treatments/<id> replaces it, leaving one record
      [32m✔[39m DELETE /api/v3/treatments/<id>?permanent=true removes it
